codex
The new residual shows repeated digit iterations, so the mathematical fold is no longer the blocker—the circularity is missing its cutpoint. This semantics recurs on internal `#while(...)`, not the surface `While(...)`; I’m moving both invariant claims to that exact fixed-semantics loop head.
